 to base my RG upon his B model. I deeply appreciate this and stress that credit for the foundation airframe and its modeling belong to Sonny; his is really well done. I encourage you to fly his plane as well.","topics":[],"score":173453,"global_rank":416517},{"name":"johnnybryan/CRUD","owner":"johnnybryan","html_url":"https://github.com/johnnybryan/CRUD","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":173453,"global_rank":416518},{"name":"boezzz/Model-Plane-Remote-Control-System","owner":"boezzz","html_url":"https://github.com/boezzz/Model-Plane-Remote-Control-System","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A model plane remote control system. It use raspberrypi on the plane. It use socket communication to let the raspbarrypi and controller PC to communicate with cloud server. No remote distance limit!","topics":[],"score":173451,"global_rank":416520},{"name":"lpatino10/diagnosis-test","owner":"lpatino10","html_url":"https://github.com/lpatino10/diagnosis-test","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":173451,"global_rank":416521},{"name":"teressas/JAVA-DEC2021","owner":"teressas","html_url":"https://github.com/teressas/JAVA-DEC2021","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":173449,"global_rank":416523},{"name":"plohrmann/Versioning","owner":"plohrmann","html_url":"https://github.com/plohrmann/Versioning","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Testing","topics":[],"score":173448,"global_rank":416524},{"name":"swegner/github-sandbox","owner":"swegner","html_url":"https://github.com/swegner/github-sandbox","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Sandbox project to try various GitHub features","topics":[],"score":173448,"global_rank":416525},{"name":"hughgramel/first-contributions","o